{"start": "00:00:01.200", "end": "00:00:03.360", "text": "All right, so here we are, in front of the elephants"}
{"start": "00:00:05.318", "end": "00:00:07.974", "text": "the cool thing about these guys is that they have really..."}
{"start": "00:00:07.974", "end": "00:00:12.616", "text": "really really long trunks"}
{"start": "00:00:12.616", "end": "00:00:14.367", "text": "and that's cool"}
{"start": "00:00:14.421", "end": "00:00:15.733", "text": "(baaaaaaaaaaahhh!!)"}
{"start": "00:00:16.881", "end": "00:00:18.881", "text": "and that's pretty much all there is to say"}
